"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
1234,"Ahmad bin Abdul Rahman bin Wahb told us, my uncle told us, Iyad bin Abdullah told us, on the authority of Makhramah bin Sulayman, on the authority of Kurayb, On the authority of Umm Hani bint Abi Talib, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “on the day he prayed eight rak’ahs of the morning prayer, he said the salaam from each ""two rak'ahs"""
